WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Did you know not all Python packages support Polars DataFrames?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.360
For example, if you try to pass a Polars DataFrame to Seaborn, you'll get this error.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:12.980
Here are four Python libraries from Posit that provide excellent support for Polars

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:13.980
DataFrames.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:19.280
PointBlank for data visualization and quality checks, GreatTables for creating publication-ready

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:26.120
tables, Plot9 for ggplot2-style visualizations, and Mow for LLM-powered data analysis.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.980
We love Polars and work hard to make sure our Python packages support it.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.620
Check them out if you're Polars-pilled, too.

